0019: def main(grid: np.ndarray) -> np.ndarray:
0020:     """Fill the gap on the longer edge-bar side in the columns where the two edge bars overlap.
0021: 
0022:     Input structure
0023:     - The grid has a black dominant background.
0024:     - One non-background internal row is a full-width red separator.
