0026: 
0027:     Rule
0028:     - Find the column sets occupied by the top and bottom edge bars.
0029:     - Compute their column overlap.
0030:     - If the top bar is longer, paint yellow through the overlap columns from below the top row down to the separator.
0031:     - If the bottom bar is longer, paint yellow through the overlap columns from below the separator down to above the bottom row.
0032:     - Leave all original non-background pixels unchanged.
0033: 
0034:     Key insight
0035:     - The side to fill is chosen by the longer edge bar, while the fill width comes from the shared horizontal projection of both bars.
0036:     """
